      558.93
    ],
    "text": "01. Authorize the purpose for which the Society known as \u201c THE CHRISTIAN SOCIETY OF JEHOVAH\u2019S WITNESSES IN SRI LANKA \u201d situated No. 711,Station Road, Wattala as a purpose to which the powers and facilities of that Ordinance ought to be extended; and.",
